   "instruction": "On sheet 매출, add a new table named Returns whose top-left cell is H1, with four columns in this order: 월 (a date, format yyyy-mm), 지점 (text), 반품액 (a number, format #,##0) and 반품률 (a number, format 0.0%). 반품률 is a formula column: the row's 반품액 divided by the total 매출 of the same 월 and 지점 in the table Sales. The table has these rows, in this order: 2026-08, 강남, 1,240,000; 2026-08, 서초, 860,000; 2026-08, 송파, 1,015,000; 2026-08, 분당, 472,000. Change nothing else."
